   "fen": "r1bqk2r/1ppp1ppp/p1n2n2/4p3/4P3/2P2NP1/PPP2PBP/R1BQ1RK1 b kq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "dxc3"
   ],
   "spoken": "And when the trade comes, recapture with the d-pawn — opening lines for our pieces.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 14,
   "t": 1332,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/1ppp1ppp/p1n5/4p3/4n3/2P2NP1/PPP2PBP/R1BQ1RK1 w kq - 0 8",
   "line": [
    "Nxe4"
   ],
   "spoken": "Black confidently grabs on e4 — and there's a standard tactic that wins the pawn straight back.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 15,
   "t": 1376,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/1ppp1ppp/p1n5/4N3/4n3/2P3P1/PPP2PBP/R1BQ1RK1 b kq - 0 8",
   "line": [
    "Nxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight takes on e5 — a discovered attack, unveiling the bishop on g2 down the long diagonal at the knight on e4.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "the Nxe5 discovered attack"
   ]
  },
  {
