   "line": [
    "Bxe4"
   ],
   "spoken": "After the recapture we take on e4 and win the pawn back, emerging with the two bishops.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 18,
   "t": 1397,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/1pp2ppp/p2p4/4n3/4B3/2P3P1/PPP2P1P/R1BQ1RK1 w kq - 0 10",
   "line": [
    "d6"
   ],
   "spoken": "White is much better here — the bishop pair, Black's king stuck in the center, and tremendous piece mobility.",
   "kind": "main",
